  m_text: '1. Press the pedestal button to dispense a cube.   2. Throw a ball hard
    at the target.

    3. Pull the lever to switch off the fizzler, then carry the
    cube up the steps to the plate.

    4. Push the heavy block onto the 100 kg
    plate.   All three -> AND -> 1 s delay -> door.'
